{10014}{I'm all done with that...}{I'm all done with that...}{}{}{}{ }
{12016}{Sorry, old chap.  I don't travel with people as evil as yourself...}{Sorry, madam.  I don't travel with people as evil as yourself...}{}{}{}{ }
{12017}{Eh...no, I don't think so.  I really just don't like you much...}{Eh...no, I don't think so.  I really just don't like you much...}{}{}{}{ }
{12018}{Alright then!  Good day to you!}{Alright then!  Good day to you!}{}{22}{}{ }
