{12022}{Hullo!  You're hitting the wrong chap!}{Hullo!  You're hitting the wrong chap!}{}{}{}{ }
{12023}{Bravo!  Jolly good strike, my good man!}{Bravo!  Jolly good strike, madam!}{}{}{}{ }
{12024}{Oh!  That wasn't your most skillful strike...}{Oh!  That wasn't your most skillful strike...}{}{}{}{ }
{12026}{No...I think you've fully outfitted this group.  Too many for my tastes...}{No...I think you've fully outfitted this group.  Too many for my tastes...}{}{}{}{ }
