{12029}{Well!  That's my cue to leave!}{Well!  That's my cue to leave!}{}{}{}{ }
{12047}{I say!  What in the bloody hell are you doing?  Don't attack our friends!}{I say!  What in the bloody hell are you doing?  Don't attack our friends!}{}{}{}{ }
{12048}{Wait!  We shouldn't attack this person!  They're alright in my book!}{Wait!  We shouldn't attack this person!  They're alright in my book!}{}{}{}{ }
{12049}{Hold on moment!  This person is from my home town!}{Hold on moment!  This person is from my home town!}{}{}{}{ }
{12050}{No!  This person is a friend of mine!}{No!  This person is a friend of mine!}{}{}{}{ }
{12052}{You'd best watch yourself!  You get any more evil, and you'll be adventuring without Franklin Payne...}{You'd best watch yourself!  You get any more evil, and you'll be adventuring without Franklin Payne...}{}{}{}{ }
{12053}{Hate to be a bother, old boy.  But I must tell you that I'm really beginning to dislike you.  If it doesn't change, we may need to go our separate ways...}{Hate to be a bother, madam.  But I must tell you that I'm really beginning to dislike you.  If it doesn't change, we may need to go our separate ways...}{}{}{}{ }
